# OPTIONAL. The contact form works without this file.
#
# Consultations are delivered by FormSubmit (https://formsubmit.co) straight to
# the address in src/config.ts (braki.abogados@gmail.com). No account needed.
#
# IMPORTANT — one-time activation: the first submission does not arrive in the
# inbox. FormSubmit emails that address asking to confirm it. Click the link in
# that email once, and every later submission is delivered.
#
# After activating, FormSubmit shows a random endpoint token. Setting it here
# keeps the email address out of the built page source, where scrapers look.
VITE_FORMSUBMIT_TOKEN=
